meta {
  name: Get Out of Borough Dashboard
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/v1/house/:houseId/young-persons/:youngPersonId/out-of-borough
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  ~from_date: 2026-01-01
  ~to_date: 2026-01-31
  ~mfc_type: unauthorized_absence
}

params:path {
  houseId: 2
  youngPersonId: 4
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Out of Borough Dashboard
  
  Returns comprehensive dashboard data for Out of Borough young persons, including:
  - **MFC Logs**: Missing From Care logs (authorized absence, unauthorized absence, report to police)
  - **Incident Logs**: Incident and accident records
  - **LADO Logs**: Local Authority Designated Officer referrals
  
  ## Query Parameters (Optional):
  - `from_date` - Filter records from this date (YYYY-MM-DD)
  - `to_date` - Filter records to this date (YYYY-MM-DD)
  - `mfc_type` - Filter MFC logs by type: `authorized_absence`, `unauthorized_absence`, `report_to_police_mfc`
  
  ## Response Example:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "mfc_logs": {
        "data": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "type": "unauthorized_absence",
            "missing_date": "2025-12-10T00:00:00.000000Z",
            "return_date": "2025-12-12T00:00:00.000000Z",
            "return_interview_requested_social_worker": "Yes",
            "return_interview_held": "Yes",
            "police_ref_no": "Dummy",
            "action_taken": "---"
          }
        ],
        "total": 1
      },
      "incident_logs": {
        "data": [
          {
            "id": 3,
            "no": "BRT/INC/00003",
            "incident_datetime": "2025-12-12T00:00:00.000000Z",
            "reason_of_incident": "Self-harm | Room Search",
            "restraint": "No",
            "sanction_given": "N/A",
            "incident_report_sent_to_sw": "N/A",
            "action_taken": "---"
          }
        ],
        "total": 1
      },
      "lado_logs": {
        "data": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "no": 1,
            "activity_time": "2025-12-10T11:20:00.000000Z",
            "reason_for_contact": "Advice Sought",
            "contact_person_name": "John Wick",
            "contact_person_phone": "+4778527633910",
            "contact_person_email": "johnwick123@gmail.com",
            "action_taken": "---"
          }
        ],
        "total": 1
      }
    },
    "message": "Out of Borough data retrieved successfully"
  }
  ```
  
  ## MFC Types:
  - `authorized_absence` - Authorized Absence (approved leave)
  - `unauthorized_absence` - Unauthorized Absence (missing without permission)
  - `report_to_police_mfc` - Report to Police MFC (police involvement)
  
  ## Notes:
  - All logs are sorted by date (most recent first)
  - Totals indicate the number of records for each log type
  - Action tracking placeholders show "---" for future implementation
}
